    "name": "blog-notebooklm",
    "description": "Query Google NotebookLM notebooks for source-grounded, citation-backed answers from user-uploaded documents. Manages notebook library, handles Google authentication, and supports smart discovery. Works standalone via /blog notebooklm or internally from blog-write and blog-researcher for Tier 1 research data. Falls back gracefully when not configured. Use when user says \"notebooklm\", \"notebook\", \"query notebook\", \"ask notebook\", \"notebook research\", \"source grounded research\", \"document query\", \"notebook library\".\n",
